1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Morning, Sam. Did you finally fix the coffee machine?

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:06,100
I tried, but it keeps making that weird noise.

3
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:09,000
We need to figure out what's wrong before the meeting.

4
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,800
Relax, I'm gonna call the repair guy after lunch.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,600
You always say that, and then you forget to call.

6
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:17,500
Okay, fine. I'll call him right now. Happy?

7
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:20,300
Very happy. Now help me set up the projector.

8
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:23,400
The cable is too short. We need a longer cable.

9
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:26,200
Check the drawer under the window. There's a spare one.

10
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:29,100
Found it! This cable is long enough for the whole room.

11
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:32,000
Great. Did you finish the report for the client?

12
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:35,000
Almost. I still have to check the numbers one more time.

13
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:38,100
The client is coming at ten, so don't give up now.

14
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:41,000
I won't give up. I just need another cup of coffee.

15
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:44,000
Too bad the coffee machine is still broken.

16
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:47,300
Then I'll buy coffee at the shop across the street.

17
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:50,100
Buy one for me too. I'm falling asleep at my desk.

18
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:53,200
Deal. Can you look after the projector while I'm gone?

19
00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:56,000
Sure. I'll test the slides and check the sound.

20
00:00:56,200 --> 00:00:59,100
If the client asks about the budget, tell them I'll call back.

21
00:00:59,300 --> 00:01:02,000
Don't worry. I can handle a few questions about the budget.

22
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:05,100
You're the best. Let's figure out the rest after the meeting.

23
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,000
Wait, the repair guy just called. He's coming this afternoon.

24
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:11,000
Finally! Maybe tomorrow we'll have real coffee again.

25
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:14,000
Don't get your hopes up. That machine is older than me.
